    {
      "v": 5,
      "zh": "亚兰王利汛和以色列王利玛利的儿子比加上来攻打耶路撒冷，围困亚哈斯，却不能胜他。",
      "en": "At that time King Rezin of Syria and King Pekah son of Remaliah of Israel attacked Jerusalem.[NOTE:1] They besieged Ahaz,[NOTE:2] but were unable to conquer him.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “went up to Jerusalem for battle.”",
        "That is, Jerusalem, Ahaz’s capital city.",
