    {
      "v": 7,
      "zh": "亚哈斯差遣使者去见亚述王提革拉．毗列色，说：「我是你的仆人、你的儿子。现在亚兰王和以色列王攻击我，求你来救我脱离他们的手。」",
      "en": "Ahaz sent messengers to King Tiglath-Pileser of Assyria, saying, “I am your servant and your dependent.[NOTE:1] March up and rescue me from the power[NOTE:2] of the king of Syria and the king of Israel, who have attacked[NOTE:3] me.”",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “son.” Both terms (“servant” and “son”) reflect Ahaz’s subordinate position as Tiglath-Pileser’s subject.",
        "Heb “hand, palm.”",
        "Heb “who have arisen against.”"
      ],
